The `wit/deps` packages are taken as given. The world imports `http-client`, but the current graph definition grants only `inference-llm`. A validator that checks the component against the current graph will reject it until your next release updates the definition.

The enrichment call uses `fetch`, so a transport failure is ignored and the output does not change. A request to a host outside the handle's allowlist is still a trap and would fail the node. The enrichment record is fetched and discarded.

