I've left out the `http-client` import and the enrichment fetch. The node's `with` clause grants only `aap:caps/inference-llm@0.1.0`, and that clause is its entire authority, so a world importing `http-client` would be rejected at link time. The fetch would also send each item's text to an outside endpoint, which the current grant doesn't permit. Once the graph definition grants `http-client`, adding the import and the call is a small change. The node's output is the same either way.

